  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This open beta introduces removal of IK tweening for hidden avatars, to increase performance savings.\nIt might be valuable to extend that logic by allowing users to also skip IK tweening without hiding the avatar.\nIt's worth trying. In some cases, like crowds, it might be less noticeable to show a bunch of distant avatars with jittery IK than to have them be invisible diamonds.\nThis could be configured by separate sliders analogous to the avatar hiding sliders, i.e. for distance filtering and for count filtering.",
